OL,3,APope warns against 'losing humanity' to
OL,4,AAI machines
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV has issued a warning about
OL,7,Fthe dangers of artificial intelligence
OL,8,F(AI) at the start of his four-day visit
OL,9,Fto France.
OL,11,FThe pontiff cautioned against "losing
OL,12,Four humanity amid a paradise of
OL,13,Fmachines" in wide-ranging remarks to
OL,14,FChurch and state officials at the
OL,15,FElysee Palace, following an hour of
OL,16,Ftalks with President Emmanuel Macron.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
