OL,3,APope warns against 'losing humanity' to
OL,4,AAI machines
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe highpoint of his visit is set to be
OL,7,Fa giant Mass attended by more than half
OL,8,Fa million people in Paris on Saturday,
OL,9,Ffor which an altar has been built on
OL,10,Fthe Place de la Concorde and a large
OL,11,Farea around the Champs-Elysees sealed
OL,12,Foff by police.
OL,14,FLarge crowds expected throughout the
OL,15,Ftrip, reflecting an enthusiasm that the
OL,16,FChurch attributes to growing
OL,17,Fspirituality among the French and other
OL,18,FEuropeans.
